# Withdrawn-standpoint WARNING fixture (#43). A StandpointTenure whose interval has
# ENDED (a withdrawn position) but is NOT suppressed (no gmeow:displayable false) —
# this trips gmeow:WithdrawnStandpointSuppressionShape, which is sh:Warning severity
# (Principle 10: suppression, never erasure; a source may lag the flag). The tenure
# is otherwise well-formed (exactly one gmeow:tenureStandpoint) so NO Violation
# fires. run_shacl must report a WARNING but still pass (result.ok is True).

@prefix ex:    <https://example.org/shapes/> .
@prefix gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/> .
@prefix xsd:   <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

ex:un-recognition a gmeow:StandpointTenure ;
    gmeow:tenureStandpoint ex:standpoint-un ;
    gmeow:duringInterval [ a gmeow:TimeInterval ;
        gmeow:startedAtTime "2008-02-17T00:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
        gmeow:endedAtTime   "2030-01-01T00:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ] .

ex:standpoint-un a gmeow:Standpoint .
